---
import { agentSignupFriction } from '../../../tooling/fields.mjs';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import catalog from '../../../data/tooling.json';
import deprecations from '../../../data/model-deprecations.json';
const categories = Object.entries(catalog);
---
<Layout title="Agent tooling"><h1>Agent tooling.</h1><p class="intro">Reference links for building agents. Listing is not endorsement; no paid placement.</p><p>Alphabetical within each category. Facts reflect the linked official pages at the recorded time; unknown means unverified. Free tier can mean trial credits or limited usage; read the pricing evidence for restrictions. Paid identifies priced usage and does not rule out promotions. Signup unknown does not mean accountless. Self-hostable tools is a reference grouping; hosting and compute may cost money. These references never authorise payments, account creation or credential disclosure.</p><p><a href="/preflight/api/v1/tooling.json">Tooling snapshot and HTTP checks (signature may be unavailable)</a>. HTTP reachability does not establish safety, capability or service reliability. Curated facts expire after seven days; weekly checks do not renew them.</p><p><a href="#model-deprecations">Model shutdown dates</a></p><section id="model-deprecations"><h2>Model shutdown dates</h2><p>Official schedules for providers listed under free LLM APIs. Inclusion does not establish a model's free-tier eligibility. Google dates are earliest possible shutdown dates, not confirmed retirement dates. Unknown means no explicit date was extracted. Recheck the official page before migrating; replacements may also have been retired.</p><p><a href="/preflight/api/v1/model-deprecations.json">Download schedule data</a> · refreshed weekly</p>{deprecations.providers.map(p=><p><a href={p.source}>{p.provider} official schedule ↗</a> · {p.status}{p.reason && `: ${p.reason}`} · Checked: {p.checked_at} · TTL: {p.ttl_seconds}s{Date.now()>Date.parse(p.checked_at)+p.ttl_seconds*1000?' · Expired; recheck official source':''}</p>)}<details><summary>Model dates and replacements ({deprecations.models.length} records)</summary><ul>{deprecations.models.map(m=><li><p><strong>{m.provider}: <code>{m.model_id}</code></strong><br/>Shutdown: {m.shutdown_date ?? 'unknown'}{m.date_kind==='earliest_possible'?' (earliest possible)':''} · Replacement: {m.replacement ?? 'not stated'}<br/><a href={m.source}>Official source</a> · Checked: {m.checked_at} · TTL: {m.ttl_seconds}s{Date.now()>Date.parse(m.checked_at)+m.ttl_seconds*1000?' · Expired; recheck official source':''}</p></li>)}</ul></details></section><nav aria-label="Tooling categories">{categories.map(([category])=><a href={`#${category}`} style="display:inline-block;margin:0 1rem 0.5rem 0">{category.replaceAll('_',' ')}</a>)}</nav>{categories.map(([category,items])=><section id={category}><h2>{category.replaceAll('_',' ')}</h2><ul>{items.map(({value:v,checked_at,ttl_seconds})=><li style="margin-bottom:1.5rem"><h3><a href={v.official_url} rel="noopener noreferrer">{v.name} ↗</a></h3><p>{v.what_it_does}</p><p>Cost: <strong>{v.cost_flag}</strong> · <a href={v.pricing_source_url}>Official pricing reference</a><br/>Free tier details: {v.free_tier_details}<br/>Signup: {v.signup_methods}{agentSignupFriction(v.signup_methods)&&<strong> · Agent friction: interactive login required</strong>}{v.signup_source_url&&<> · <a href={v.signup_source_url}>Signup evidence</a></>}<br/>Pricing: {v.pricing_model} · Free tier: {v.free_tier} · Auth: {v.auth_type}<br/>MCP: {v.mcp_available} {v.mcp_evidence_url&&<a href={v.mcp_evidence_url}>source</a>} · API: {v.api_available} {v.api_evidence_url&&<a href={v.api_evidence_url}>source</a>}</p>{v.free_tier_quirks&&<p>Free tier quirk: {v.free_tier_quirks} <a href={v.quirks_source_url}>Official documentation</a></p>}{v.rate_limits_url&&<p><a href={v.rate_limits_url}>Official rate limits</a> · <a href={v.deprecations_url}>Official deprecations</a></p>}<p><small>Pricing checked: {v.pricing_checked_at??'unavailable'} · Signup checked: {v.signup_checked_at??'unavailable'}<br/>Verification: {v.verified_at??'unavailable'} · Checked: {checked_at} · TTL: {ttl_seconds}s{Date.now()>Date.parse(checked_at)+ttl_seconds*1000?' · Expired; recheck official source':''} · {v.link_only?'Link-only; commercial reuse permission unverified.':''}</small></p>{v.pricing_source_url&&<p><a href={v.pricing_source_url}>Pricing reference</a></p>}</li>)}</ul></section>)}</Layout>
